N 7897707501274 Código do Fabricante SCF01 Combustível GASOLINA Combustível Gasolina', 154.7, 154.7, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Ignition', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rbkb-lltafwf8lxnt8b', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F817551928%2F19761853799', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
