previsíveis, bem como Greve dos Correios.', 29.9, 28.9, NULL, 'Home & Living > Home Fragrance & Aromatherapy > Essential Oils', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-lnd0e5md452h50', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F313968882%2F8412144831', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
