s a week.✔ 2.We sell 100% genuine.✔ 3.Chatable time: all the time [24/7]. ************************************************** sulwhasoo yeoyun pack overnight vitalizing mask 35g Sulwhasoo (Yeoyun Pack) Overnight Vitalizing Mask 35g 🌟 Oriental sleeping mask that provides moisture and nutrition at night to help revive the skin''s natural luster the next day. 1 morning glow at night Jujube strengthens the skin barrier and pomegranate has excellent antioxidant properties. Yeo Yun Pack contains Yeo Yun Red Liquor™, which consists of jujube and pomegranate extracts. Moisture and nutrition are supplied while you sleep, and you can see your skin rejuvenated in the morning. 2 All-night comfort formula technology Yeoyun Pack is a sleeping mask that can be used without discomfort while sleeping. It creates a skin-friendly surface structure to form a skin moisturizing film. Reduces water loss during the night and provides ample nutrition. 3 Comfort Wave Technology™ that takes care of your heart After a long research, Sulwhasoo introduced the herbal aroma scent into the Yeo Yoon Pack. Comfort Wave Technology™, which cares about the inner part of human beings, delivers peace of mind and peace of mind. You can spend a more comfortable time while using the face pack. [How to use] 1. In the last step of basic makeup, take a 100 won coin-sized amount. 2. Apply evenly over the entire face except around the eyes and lips. 3. Wait about 5 minutes until it soaks in and get a good night''s sleep. 4. Wash off with lukewarm water the next morning. #Nutritional radiance #Oriental medicine sleeping mask #Sulwhasoo -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- ❤Three Promises of KOKSARA COSMETICS 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.✔ 2.We sell 100% genuine.✔ 3.Chatable time: all the time [24/7].', 57.02, 48.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Face Mask & Packs', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-8258l-mfw9r4w1kxl583', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F15700138476', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
