—————————————————————————————————————— ♡Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√ —————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————', 120.0, 118.8, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Facial Moisturizer', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rcd9-lsmai8m4sn5n7a', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F19085320406', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
