ke type of ultra-glowing toner for recurrent extremely dry skin. Shakran adds a moisturizing film to 7 types of hyaluronic acid A total of 8 types of layering moisturizing ingredients provide ultra-glowing moisture that builds up the more you apply it. Among them, the representative ingredient is fermented hyaluronic acid and hyaluron biome. It is a low-molecular-weight hyaluronic acid made by fermenting lactic acid into hyaluronic acid, a moisturizing ingredient. Attracts moisture and strengthens the barrier Retains moisture to make you more moisturized Sacran covers the moisture film and provides long-lasting moisture. [How to use] Take an appropriate amount in the palm of your hand, pat gently and spread onto the skin. For better absorption, lightly pat the skin with the warmth of your hands. [Product capacity] 170ml #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty #good product #good price #hadalabo ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ——————————— 🩶Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√ ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ———————————', 181.14, 109.5, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Facial Moisturizer', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rceh-lsmej8hgds2wcf', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F24217599953', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
