l ingredients 4 Signature perfume using professional perfume technology, 8 scents Discover the luxurious scent created through premium blending by a professional perfumer for a long-lasting, fragrant memory of Raip''s signature scent. 🩵Very Berry A scent that combines sweet berry scent and elegant floral scent to create a romantic and lovely feeling. 🩵White Soap A scent that leaves you feeling clean and soft as if you just got out of the shower, giving you pleasant comfort all day long. 🩵Grapefruit A refreshing, refreshing grapefruit scent that brings dynamism and vitality to a boring day. 🩵Baby Powder A soft and cozy scent that conveys the loveliness and innocence of a baby. 🩵Original An attractive floral scent with an appropriate mix of floral, vanilla, and musk scents. 🩵Lovely A lovely floral scent that leaves you feeling pleasantly sweet and fresh. 🩵Elegance A floral scent that emphasizes elegance and luxury and leaves a subtle, calm lingering scent. 🩵Ocean Blue A unique scent that combines a lively fresh scent with a subtle lingering scent. [How to use] 1 After shampooing, prepare hair to be moist. 2 Take an appropriate amount into your hand. 3 Apply evenly from the ends to the middle of the hair. [Vol', 100.5, 79.85, NULL, 'Beauty > Hair Care > Hair Treatment', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rd5c-luokm1ih7c7m31', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F25577280690', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
