Sports & Outdoors > Sports & Outdoor Recreation Equipments > Cycling', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/e6b1eedc85cf55a011da84070ee3fad8', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F333705502%2F17285436906', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
