ools & Home Improvement > Tools', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7r98o-lklftuzaa2ex20', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F674110767%2F22892263508', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
